cmu-residue-alien = Their skin is covered in alien blood and acid residue. They need a shower.
cmu-residue-blood = Their skin is blood-stained. They need a shower.
cmu-shower-on = You turn the shower on. Remove your uniform and outer suit to wash your skin.
cmu-shower-off = You turn the shower off.
cmu-shower-auto-off = The shower automatically shuts off.
cmu-shower-running = Water is running. Stand under it without a uniform or outer suit for eight seconds to wash.
cmu-shower-idle = The shower is off. Activate it to turn on the water.
cmu-shower-clean = You wash the blood and residue off your skin.
cmu-laundry-start = Start wash cycle
cmu-laundry-remote-start = The washer/dryer starts its cycle remotely.
cmu-laundry-cancel = Cancel wash cycle
cmu-laundry-empty = Load some clothing first.
cmu-laundry-idle = The red indicator is on. Load clothing, then Alt-click to start a wash cycle.
cmu-laundry-running = The green indicator is on and the drum is swirling. Alt-click to cancel and unlock it.
cmu-laundry-on = You turn the washer/dryer on. The drum begins to swirl.
cmu-laundry-off = You turn the washer/dryer off. The drum stops and unlocks.
cmu-laundry-done = Ding! The washer/dryer finishes its cycle and unlocks.
cmu-sink-wash = Wash yourself
cmu-sink-wash-start = You begin washing yourself.
cmu-sink-wash-done = You wash the blood and alien residue off your skin.


cmu-cloth-uses = Uses remaining: { $uses }.
cmu-cloth-spent = This cloth is used up.
cmu-cloth-already-clean = There is no blood or residue to wipe away.
cmu-cloth-start = You begin wiping away blood and residue.
cmu-cloth-finish = You wipe the blood and residue off the skin and worn clothing.
cmu-cloth-used-name = used field washcloth
cmu-cloth-used-desc = A dirty cleansing cloth. It has no cleaning uses left.

cmu-laundry-no-power = The washer/dryer has no power. Connect it to a powered supply first.
cmu-laundry-power-lost = The washer/dryer loses power. The cycle stops and the drum unlocks.

cmu-hamper-washer-running = The washer is running and its drum is locked. Wait for it to finish or Alt-click to cancel before loading more laundry.
cmu-hamper-transferred = Transferred { $count } items. { $remaining } remain in the hamper.
cmu-laundry-time-left = Time remaining: { $seconds } seconds.
cmu-soap-uses = Washes remaining: { $uses }.
cmu-soap-finished = The last piece of soap dissolves in your hands.

cmu-hamper-empty = The hamper is empty. There is no laundry to transfer.
cmu-hamper-no-fit = None of the remaining laundry fits in this washer. Empty its drum or try a larger washer; the laundry stays in the hamper.
cmu-hamper-transferred-all = Transferred all { $count } items into the washer. The hamper is now empty.
cmu-hamper-transferred-part = Transferred { $count } items. The rest will not fit; { $remaining } remain in the hamper.

cmu-hamper-transfer-start = You begin transferring laundry into the washer.

cmu-laundry-broken = The washer/dryer is broken, with torn panels and exposed wiring. Repair it with a blowtorch before washing. Stored laundry can still be retrieved.
cmu-laundry-breakdown = The washer/dryer breaks down! Its cycle stops without cleaning the load.
cmu-laundry-repaired = The washer/dryer is repaired and can wash again once powered.

cmu-laundry-cookoff = Ammunition cracks inside the washer/dryer, spraying fragments through the front!

cmu-soap-floor-cleaned = You scrub the floor with the soap.
cmu-soap-floor-instructions = Click a floor spill or blood mark to scrub it away without water. Each successful pass uses one wash.

cmu-laundry-explosive-melting = { CAPITALIZE(THE($item)) } begins to melt inside the washer/dryer!

cmu-shower-switch-on = Turn on
cmu-shower-switch-off = Turn off
cmu-shower-time-left = Automatic shutoff in { $seconds } seconds.
cmu-residue-blood-light = A few traces of blood mark their skin.
cmu-residue-blood-heavy = Accumulated blood stains their skin.
cmu-residue-alien-light = A few traces of alien blood and acid residue mark their skin.
cmu-residue-alien-heavy = Accumulated alien blood and acid residue stains their skin.
